.TH WENCESLAS 1
.SH NAME
wenceslas \- snow rescue game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/wenceslas
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Wenceslas
is a port of the TempleOS
.B Demo/Games/Wenceslas.HC
game of Good King Wenceslas.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
It opens with the carol, on two pages, and then the instructions; any
key turns each page, and the last one starts the clock.
.PP
Ten peasants wander a snowfield.
Walk the king over a tree and press space to set it alight; a peasant
that comes within twenty pixels of a burning tree stops there to warm
itself, and one that reaches the house in the middle goes inside.
Peasants steer toward the king's own footprints, preferring the
freshest within fifteen pixels, so the king leads them by walking.
The clock stops when no peasant is left out in the cold, and the best
time is kept between runs.
.PP
Footprints are dark for two seconds and then fade into the snow, which
keeps falling and settling on the king, the peasants, the trees and
the house.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B "any key"
Turn the opening pages
.TP
.B arrows
Move the king
.TP
.B space
Set light to any tree the king is standing on
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
